      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6720839771742208
    m_Localized: "Is tusa Declan Kelly, fear sna fichid\xED at\xE1 ina ch\xF3na\xED
      i gceantar tuaithe in \xC9irinn sa bhliain 2008, d\xEDreach tar \xE9is do \u2018Leabhar
      an T\xEDogair Cheiltigh\u2019 titim as a ch\xE9ile agus gach post fi\xFAntach
      a scuabadh leis.\r\n\r\nN\xEDl aon obair sheasmhach le f\xE1il i do cheantar
      f\xE9in, t\xE1 Baile \xC1tha Cliath r\xF3-chostasach, agus is \xED an t-aon
      seans d\xE1ir\xEDre at\xE1 agat n\xE1 dul go dt\xED an Astr\xE1il chun airgead
      maith a thuilleamh ag obair sna mianaigh n\xF3 ar l\xE1ithre\xE1in t\xF3g\xE1la.\r\n\r\nAch
      teasta\xEDonn \u20AC5,000 ar a laghad uait sula rachaidh an deis chun v\xEDosa
      oibre a fh\xE1il in \xE9ag; mar sin, t\xE1 foireann gharbh de r\xE1s\xF3ir\xED
      curacha \xE1iti\xFAla curtha le ch\xE9ile agat chun na r\xE1sa\xED D\xE9 Domhnaigh
      a bhuachan.\r\n\r\nT\xE1 s\xE9 i gceist agat sciar den airgead geallt\xF3ireachta
      a th\xF3g\xE1il agus d\xF3thain airgid a bhaili\xFA le h\xE9al\xFA."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6721570193006592
    m_Localized: "N\xEDl an t-imreoir tar \xE9is dul isteach in aon l\xE9ig."
